title: meetingKate
position: -540,-238
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Before you sits a woman in her mid-forties, beautiful with the ghosts of wrinkles beginning to etch themselves onto her face.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][A gold-embroidered corset, patterned with proud peacocks, cinches her waist impossibly tight beneath cascading dark red hair and a shimmering sequined dress.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Pale legs in lace stockings cross elegantly as crimson nails trace the rim of a glass filled with something far darker than wine.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Bathed in soft vermillion light, her armchair is her throne, the perch of this room's red queen.][/nomarkup]
<<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is false>>
    {$sforzaMask}: Kieran. Back so soon? Hope Dominic didn't run you off. Who's your friend?
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Her eyes are turned on you. She speaks with an Italian accent.][/nomarkup]
<<else>>
    {$sforzaMask}: Kieran, back so soon? Hope Dominic didn't run you off. Who are your friends?
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Her eyes are turned on you. She speaks with an Italian accent.][/nomarkup] #line:069afd3
    <<set $anastasiaIntroduced to true>>
    {$anastasia}: Anastasia. Charmed, m'lady. 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kate seems unimpressed, a deadpan expression resting on her face.][/nomarkup]
    {$sforzaMask}: A pleasure for you to finally introduce yourself! I cannot imagine why we didn't get together sooner. Were you afraid that I'd bite?
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kate's smile doesn't reach her eyes, but she allows this particular insult to go unpunished.][/nomarkup] #line:07c201d
<<endif>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran's demeanor noticeably changes around Kate; he's more skittish and docile than his usual self.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He clears his throat upon noticing your gaze. He's clearly embarrassed.][/nomarkup] 
{$kieran}:Good evening, Kate. You surely remember that Dominic decided to take me with him on one of his “missions”. This is the fledgling we were tasked with apprehending. #line:0e13aca 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Incredulous, she lifts an eyebrow.][/nomarkup]
{$sforzaMask}: I can see Dominic is trying to start another scandal in the Court. How nice of him. 
{$sforzaMask}: Does Prince Douglas know? #line:056e742
{$kieran}: I'll leave their marital drama up to them, but by now she probably knows. And if not now, then she will soon. As for your guest…
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He turns to you.][/nomarkup] 
{$sforzaMask}: I know who she is. You're the one who managed to expose that little blackmail operation our dear Prince was running. I'm surprised you lived long enough to be Embraced into one of us. 
{$kieran}: Dominic is of the opinion that she has enough potential for a simple execution to be a waste. Her first task is to find her sire to minimize the scandal.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][This is not how events unfolded in your apartment. It was Kieran who needed to convince Dominic of your competence, not the other way around...][/nomarkup] #line:01efab0 
{$sforzaMask}: Interesting. 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She gives you an ocular pat down, eyeing the length of your figure, and smiles.][/nomarkup] 
{$sforzaMask}: I suppose if Dominic believes you're worth violating our Traditions over, then you must be something quite special?
{$sforzaMask}: Good luck with this little test, my dear, and do come back if you succeed? Don't forget to tell me all about it, I'm so curious!
-> {$pcName}: Thank you. #line:099b710 
    {$sforzaMask}: At least you know your manners. That helps. (+1 Kieran Influence) #lastline #line:05b5dd3 
    <<ModifyInfluence 1 {$kieran}>>
    <<jump questionsAboutLastNight>>
-> {$pcName}: Probably not. 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She laughs, yet her tone is far from amused.][/nomarkup] 
    {$sforzaMask}: My dear, you should learn to be more guarded with your intentions if you wish to become someone in the nights.
    <<ModifyInfluence -1 {$kieran}>>
    {$kieran}: She does have a fiery temperament, but... it is to be expected, given her Blood. #line:00590a3 
    {$sforzaMask}: Another Brujah? 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She sighs and rolls her eyes.][/nomarkup] 
    {$sforzaMask}: I would heartily endorse some anger management classes and, if you hope to last a few years more, not to lean on excuses. #line:0179d9d #lastline
    <<jump questionsAboutLastNight>>
===
title: questionsAboutLastNight
position: -212,-233
---
-> {$pcName}: I came here last night. Do you remember me? Who was I with?
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Her lips curl in an amused grin as her eyes drift off to the side, her focus turning towards her own memories.][/nomarkup]
{$sforzaMask}: Yes, I do remember seeing you here.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She remarks off-handedly, a devious grin coming to her lips.][/nomarkup]
{$sforzaMask}: You were on the dancefloor and found yourself something of a partner in crime and left before I had the opportunity to thank you for your article.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She makes a wide, sweeping gesture with her hand.][/nomarkup]
{$sforzaMask}: Maybe he's your sire? 
<<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is true>>
    {$anastasia}: And I thought [nomarkup]<i>I</i>[/nomarkup] was messy. 
<<endif>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][That must have been the man from your shower.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: Maybe, but I think the most sound conclusion is that he's the individual we found in her apartment, based on the evidence we have already collected. 
{$sforzaMask}: Making a mess already, piccola mia? You must be smarter than that.
{$sforzaMask}: I'm sure Kieran will help you realize your full potential, and in time, build you into an upstanding member of the Praxis.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She gazes meaningfully at you both.][/nomarkup]
{$sforzaMask}: He is [nomarkup]<i>my</i>[/nomarkup] childe, after all. 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran only reciprocates with a shallow nod, though there may be some pride in the way he glances at you momentarily.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: Did we leave with anybody else? #line:0f44f9e 
{$sforzaMask}: My dear, if you left with anyone else, I can't say. I was... preoccupied. 
<<jump kateFarewell>>
===
