title: kateNudgesTowardAnastasia
position: 436,-587
---
{$sforzaMask}: Diana says her name is Anastasia, my dear. A Kindred, if you can believe it. She's shown up the past few nights, but hasn't done me the courtesy of introducing herself...
<<set $anaIsVampire to true>>
{$kieran}: You're tolerating a poacher in your domain? #line:0691cc7
{$sforzaMask}: She hasn't poached yet, but I'd rather not delay our introduction before she does. Make that happen for me, will you?
-> [nomarkup][End conversation.][/nomarkup]
