title: howSheStarted
position: -70,220
---
{$sforzaMask}: Diana owns the place, piccola mia. I just look after it. It was a gift from our ever so [nomarkup]<i>>beloved</i>[/nomarkup] Prince.
{$sforzaMask}: She saw fit to bestow upon me this modest domain as a token of her gratitude after that nasty business that happened to the previous Prince.
{$sforzaMask}: I knew that The Embassy would be the perfect spot to establish a hub where Kindred could gather and socialize, a true haven for our dysfunctional little family.
{$sforzaMask}: It required a bit of remodeling and adapting to the needs of our kind, but with Diana's help and expertise, it has blossomed. #line:0709911
<<jump subsequentQuestions>>
