title: previousPrince
position: 740,281
---
{$sforzaMask}: Benedic was the Prince before Sam.
{$sforzaMask}: He was assassinated by his own Sheriff, Geoffrey Montrose, in a conspiracy with the Sabbat, but they learned their lesson.
{$sforzaMask}: They've since been hunted down and killed for their crimes against the Praxis. #line:0fbf8e9
<<jump subsequentQuestions>>
===
title: whatIsSabbat
position: 908,-62
---
{$kieran}: A bunch of savages. #line:0bd540d 
{$sforzaMask}: A dangerous, misguided organization that rejects the Camarilla's Traditions in what they justify as some sort of twisted Jyhad.
{$sforzaMask}: Benedic didn't see them as a serious threat, and thus, he suffered final death at their hands. 
{$sforzaMask}: Some advice: if I were someone in your position, I would do my very best to know as little about them as possible.
<<jump subsequentQuestions>>
===
title: whatAreTraditions
position: 964,525
---
{$kieran}: A set of six general rules that all of our kind must adhere to in order to survive. They are also the laws that Dominic is tasked with enforcing in Las Vegas as Sheriff.
<<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is true>>
    {$anastasia}: An unholy Ten Commandments.
<<endif>>
<<jump subsequentQuestions>>
===
title: camarillaExplained
position: 537,611
---
{$kieran}: A Kindred sect founded more than five hundred years ago with the Six Traditions as our core guiding tenets. All of us are members, and citizens, so to speak, of the Praxis.
{$kieran}: The institution's organization is modeled after feudalistic societies of the Middle Ages, with the Prince of a given territory being the equivalent of a Lord. #lastline
-> {$pcName}: Our Prince is a Lady, no? 
{$sforzaMask}: Women's work so rarely intersected with something so crass as leadership, you see, so when the systems were being designed, such words as “Princess” and “Lady” were neatly left out. How thoughtful of them, no?
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The tone in her voice is sweet, but the way she says the words has a distinct air of disdain. Kate smiles at you.][/nomarkup]
{$sforzaMask}: But it's different now, no? The tide of progress lifts all boats! #line:0c7e90e 
<<if Roll ("Wits","Awareness")>=4>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][It's a smile, but you get the impression it may have been bitter, once sharp and astringent, but those emotions have clearly been dulled by time.][/nomarkup] #line:0a719c9 
<<endif>>
<<jump subsequentQuestions>>
===
